  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a &#x20ac;25,000 ICMPS project entitled: &#x2018;Strengthening Household Economic Empowerment for Women and Out-Of-School Girls to End Gender-Based Violence in Kiyawa and Birnin Kudu LGAs, Jigawa State&#x2019; is a women economic empowerment and a protection advocacy and influencing project. The project is responding to the intersecting issues of poverty, GBV and education exclusion by strengthening economic resilience of women and household economic empowerment, and supporting the re-entry of girls into school or learning environments.</narrative>
  </description>
